<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
  <head>
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <style>
      body { font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; padding: 0; background-color: #f2f2f2; }
      p { margin-bottom: 16px; color: #333333; }
      .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px; border-radius: 10px; background-color: #ffffff; }
      h1 { font-size: 20px; color: #ff6600; }
      strong { color: #333; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <div class="container">
      <h1>WhatsApp number removal – Operator action required</h1>

      <p>This shop has downgraded to a plan that does not include branded WhatsApp.</p>

      <p><strong>Shop:</strong> <%= @shop_name %> (<%= @shopify_domain %>)</p>

      <p><strong>WhatsApp number to remove from Operator:</strong> <%= @previous_whatsapp_number %></p>

      <p>Please remove this number from Operator so it can be reassigned if needed.</p>
    </div>
  </body>
</html>
